{{!
    @template format_aicourse/chatbox_message

    One turn in the AI Tutor conversation: either the learner's question or the tutor's answer.
    Rendered client-side by format_aicourse/chatbox and appended to the role="log" message list, so
    every turn is announced as it arrives.

    SECURITY: `content` is either what the learner typed, something replayed out of sessionStorage
    or the raw answer returned by the third-party AI service. It is NEVER trusted and is always
    rendered with a double mustache, so any markup in it is escaped to text. There is no
    triple-mustache value in this template. For a tutor answer, format_aicourse/chatbox then
    replaces that text with nodes built by format_aicourse/local/richtext, which also never
    parses HTML.

    Classes required for JS:
    * aicourse-ai-message-content - the text, replaced by the rich rendering for tutor answers.
    * aicourse-ai-copy-btn - copies the answer's original text.
    * aicourse-ai-rating - the rating control; format_aicourse/chatbox reads data-chatid from it
      and replaces its contents with a thank-you once a rating has been sent.
    * aicourse-ai-rate-btn - a rating button.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-chatid - on .aicourse-ai-rating, the id of the stored chat message being rated.
    * data-rate - on each rating button, 1 for helpful and -1 for not helpful.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * content string The message text. Untrusted; always escaped.
    * isuser bool True for the learner's own message, false for a tutor answer.
    * iserror bool True when this is an error raised in place of an answer.
    * rateable bool True when thumbs up / thumbs down should be offered.
    * chatid string The id used when submitting a rating. Only used when rateable is true.
    * helpfullabel string Accessible name and tooltip of the thumbs up button.
    * nothelpfullabel string Accessible name and tooltip of the thumbs down button.
    * copylabel string Accessible name and visible text of the copy button.
    * restored bool True when this answer was replayed from the stored conversation.
    * restoredlabel string The "restored from history" note. Only used when restored is true.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "content": "Start by summarising the brief in your own words.",
        "isuser": false,
        "iserror": false,
        "rateable": true,
        "chatid": "42",
        "helpfullabel": "This answer was helpful",
        "nothelpfullabel": "This answer was not helpful",
        "copylabel": "Copy",
        "restored": false,
        "restoredlabel": "Restored from history"
    }
}}
<div class="aicourse-ai-message {{#isuser}}aicourse-ai-message-user{{/isuser}}{{^isuser}}aicourse-ai-message-bot{{/isuser}}{{#iserror}} aicourse-ai-message-error{{/iserror}}">{{^isuser}}<span class="aicourse-ai-avatar" aria-hidden="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 8V4H8"/><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"/><path d="M2 14h2M20 14h2M15 13v2M9 13v2"/></svg></span>{{/isuser}}<div class="aicourse-ai-message-body"><div class="aicourse-ai-message-content" dir="auto">{{content}}</div>{{^isuser}}{{^iserror}}<div class="aicourse-ai-message-tools"><button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-tool-btn aicourse-ai-copy-btn" title="{{copylabel}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="12" height="12" rx="1"/><path d="M5 15H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1"/></svg><span class="aicourse-ai-copy-text">{{copylabel}}</span></button>{{#rateable}}<div class="aicourse-ai-rating" data-chatid="{{chatid}}"><button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-tool-btn aicourse-ai-rate-btn" data-rate="1" title="{{helpfullabel}}" aria-label="{{helpfullabel}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 10v11M15 5.9 14 10h5.8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2.3l-1.4 7A2 2 0 0 1 18.4 21H7V10l4-8a3 3 0 0 1 4 3.9Z"/></svg></button><button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-tool-btn aicourse-ai-rate-btn" data-rate="-1" title="{{nothelpfullabel}}" aria-label="{{nothelpfullabel}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 14V3M9 18.1 10 14H4.2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2.3l1.4-7A2 2 0 0 1 5.6 3H17v11l-4 8a3 3 0 0 1-4-3.9Z"/></svg></button></div>{{/rateable}}{{#restored}}<span class="aicourse-ai-rating-done">{{restoredlabel}}</span>{{/restored}}</div>{{/iserror}}{{/isuser}}</div></div>
